    `the officer announced or disseminated, or permitted or authorised the announcement or dissemination of, information that is false or misleading in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the officer announce or disseminate, or permit or authorise the announcement or dissemination of, information that is false or misleading in a material particular?
